<title>DENMARK: Kommunekredit ups 4 pct 2002 bond by 100 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Kommunekredit ups 4 pct 2002 bond by 100 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Kommunekredit raised an existing four percent bond due 2002 by 100 million crowns to 1.472 billion crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement distributed by the Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The statement said that all the bonds were sold. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
